# Build-time vendored artifacts -- fetched by scripts/vendor-code-server.sh
# and scripts/vendor-termux-recipe.sh, never committed. See each script's
# own header for why (size, in code-server's case; avoiding a permanent
# git-history copy of upstream-owned recipe content, in the termux-packages
# recipe's case) and for where each one's output actually lands
# (app/src/main/assets/code-server/ and build/termux-recipe/ respectively --
# the latter already covered by the plain `build/` rule below, called out
# here so the "why" lives next to the other build-time fetch instead of
# only in the script itself).
app/src/main/assets/code-server/
.vendor-cache/

# Standard Gradle/Android
.gradle/
build/
local.properties
*.iml
.idea/
